        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "78ef9476-b405-3584-90fd-58f55bf1d40b",
                "word": "gelijkmoedigheid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                        "entry_id": "78ef9476-b405-3584-90fd-58f55bf1d40b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een toestand van psychische stabiliteit en kalmte"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "901042df-4c7b-461a-92d4-356124e4ba79",
                                "sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                                "text": "Ach ja, ik weet het wel: het tolhek bij Gerkesbrugge is door boeren verbrand, de grietman van Kollumerland heeft onder bedreiging van een woedende menigte het passagegeld afgeschaft en ook andere regenten zijn uitgescholden, maar op voorbeeld van Democritus nam ik hiervan met de grootste gelijkmoedigheid kennis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "41915fe1-b6cf-45ec-ac63-f743ae2a4e1f",
                                "sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                                "text": "Om de een of andere reden vind ik het moeilijk om iemand serieus te nemen die zijn stem denkt te moeten verheffen om gehoord te worden, iemand die boos wordt, prikkelbaar is of zichtbaar zenuwachtig. Misschien zouden Rutte, Roemer en Wilders mee kunnen doen aan deze cursus Wijsheid in Leiderschap die ik toevallig tegenkwam op de site van de Universiteit van Groningen. Wijs leiderschap is nodig in deze hectische tijd, staat er op de aankondiging, en wijs leiderschap is ‘gelijkmoedigheid en het acteren vanuit rust en balans’. De rest van het wereld is al genoeg een rotzooitje, laat de leiders die kans hebben op premierschap tenminste hun eigen emoties onder controle hebben voordat zij pretenderen een heel land goed te kunnen organiseren."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03002fb6-1954-4369-857e-709ef330eaf0",
                        "source_entry_id": "78ef9476-b405-3584-90fd-58f55bf1d40b",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                        "source_sense_description": "een toestand van psychische stabiliteit en kalmte",
                        "target_lang_word": "equanimity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "equanimity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b30645b4-d06b-39e6-8eb3-a30d64aa3c55",
                                        "entry_id": "dc9a907f-f532-3614-93e8-fe0cbea54e35",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being calm, stable and composed, especially under stress."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e01080b-1a88-49fa-9b6d-76b3227a281d",
                                                "sense_id": "b30645b4-d06b-39e6-8eb3-a30d64aa3c55",
                                                "text": "No doubt you are right, my best of friends, there would be far less suffering amongst mankind, if men—and God knows why they are so fashioned—did not employ their imaginations so assiduously in recalling the memory of past sorrow, instead of bearing their present lot with equanimity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1467e559-8235-44b3-9741-b84e68f25e7c",
                                                "sense_id": "b30645b4-d06b-39e6-8eb3-a30d64aa3c55",
                                                "text": "In the very heart of the herd the din was terrific. It was almost dizzying in its effect. I paused and smiled reassuringly at Maud, for I had recovered my equanimity sooner than she."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a33a3f1-1709-4c63-97ea-4f7c17f2e0bf",
                                                "sense_id": "b30645b4-d06b-39e6-8eb3-a30d64aa3c55",
                                                "text": "Few people are capable of expressing with equanimity opinions which differ from the prejudices of their social environment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3eea239-528d-4aeb-8fc8-8ce7ec701184",
                                                "sense_id": "b30645b4-d06b-39e6-8eb3-a30d64aa3c55",
                                                "text": "We find Hudson himself, a vision of unwavering equanimity, admitting that as a child he didn’t dare mention his acting dreams for fear they would be dismissed as “sissy stuff”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4aee9018-83c5-4b30-8a1e-b28280100c61",
                        "source_entry_id": "78ef9476-b405-3584-90fd-58f55bf1d40b",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                        "source_sense_description": "een toestand van psychische stabiliteit en kalmte",
                        "target_lang_word": "evenness of temper",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "deb97da6-da5d-4266-ae09-f506cda2af41",
                        "source_entry_id": "78ef9476-b405-3584-90fd-58f55bf1d40b",
                        "source_sense_id": "a3a6ea1a-5ebb-34df-81d4-c1513a459c19",
                        "source_sense_description": "een toestand van psychische stabiliteit en kalmte",
                        "target_lang_word": "composure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "composure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Calmness of mind or temperament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "809ad7ea-fed6-48b0-bd27-964cfc02da81",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "That all may see who hate us, how we seek\nPeace and composure […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15827bb5-1232-43da-a9ef-00542b238d3d",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "It would be also of great Use to us to form our deliberate Judgments of Persons and Things in the calmest and serenest Hours of Life, when the Passions of Nature are all silent, and the Mind enjoys its most perfect Composure […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af699b24-2944-42df-b1f9-e6ff28b402fd",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "“Did you want anything, ma’am?” I enquired, still preserving my external composure, in spite of her ghastly countenance and strange exaggerated manner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10443e7d-3ea6-479f-8dc2-882baed6bd84",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "He began to lose his composure, and made mistakes, his cards got mixed up, and his scoring was wild."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "310b26fa-94bd-447e-b0a2-225faf120e02",
                                                "sense_id": "f602aeed-bf99-32ef-a846-461d08570515",
                                                "text": "Montenegro's early composure was shaken by that set-back and a visibly buoyed Wales nearly added a second goal when Bale broke past two defenders and fired a long-range shot that Bozovic tipped over"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "759dfa33-0bc8-34d3-8357-964aceef12ca",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of composing"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ea9b986-f3e3-43c9-8fda-dc478e86b7b6",
                                                "sense_id": "759dfa33-0bc8-34d3-8357-964aceef12ca",
                                                "text": "1818, John Evelyn, Memoirs, edited by William Bray, London: Henry Colburn, 2nd edition, Volume I, entry for 10 March, 1685, p. 592,\n[…] Signʳ Pietro […] had an admirable way both of composure [in music] and teaching."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "715734af-921e-3452-81c6-01f37d2ef687",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is composed; a composition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a317a04-8dfb-31bb-b50e-bbc15d4e86c3",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Orderly adjustment; disposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd244d88-76f9-48fb-a07a-4fe68ac6c6ef",
                                                "sense_id": "1a317a04-8dfb-31bb-b50e-bbc15d4e86c3",
                                                "text": "[…] from the various Composures and Combinations of these Corpusoles together, happen all the Varieties of the Bodies formed out of them […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "591cc88a-56f2-38b4-ba94-97253877bb0b",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Frame; make; temperament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b117555-b20d-4ff9-a957-fa6627c33cb7",
                                                "sense_id": "591cc88a-56f2-38b4-ba94-97253877bb0b",
                                                "text": "[…] his composure must be rare indeed\nWhom these things can not blemish […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7537d462-a7cd-3cff-8db8-9c722e14221e",
                                        "entry_id": "233f8797-bece-31c7-9346-b61babf47671",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A combination; a union; a bond."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "444491ac-458f-4ab8-9bcf-7459be83aa9f",
                                                "sense_id": "7537d462-a7cd-3cff-8db8-9c722e14221e",
                                                "text": "[…] their fraction is more our wish than their faction: but it was a strong composure a fool could disunite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
